<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="5b276c16">&lt;p&gt;
    This task is performed throughout the test effort at regular intervals. The frequency of this task varies depending on
    project factors such as size, complexity and duration and is usually determined in the early stages of the test effort.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
